<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
  rmap render --html — self-contained static roadmap board.
  Ships inside the rmap binary via include_str!. Single file: inline CSS + JS,
  no CDN, no framework, no build step.
  Agents: parse the rmap-data JSON island near the end, do not scrape the DOM.
  Shared design system: templates/_styles.css + templates/_board.js, injected
  verbatim so this and the portfolio view speak one visual language.
-->
<html lang="en">
{% import "components.html" as c %}
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ project }} — Roadmap board</title>
<style>{{ styles | safe }}</style>
</head>
<body>
<!--
  THESIS: every task is a T-card slotted into an aluminium planning board; the
  card's stock colour is its lane, and pulling a card out shows its full spec.
  Refuses the dark neon kanban dashboard.
  OWN-WORLD: anodized aluminium ground, black engraved label plates, card stock
  in canary (ready) / sky (active) / salmon (hold) / buff (waiting) / green
  (done), red rubber stamps for HOLD and VOID, index-card reverse for specs.
  STORY: see what can move, what moves, what is stuck; pull any card to read
  and understand its spec; follow the wiring to see why it waits.
  FIRST VIEWPORT: engraved project plate + lane counters, then the Dispatch
  racks (Ready / Active / Hold) before any phase board.
  FORM: T-card planning board, grounded list #7, seed c29fcb8f.
  FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, DESIGN.md, and every shipping raster carrying its provenance
-->

<header class="masthead">
  <div class="masthead-inner">
    <div class="nameplate">
      <span class="nameplate-kind">rmap board</span>
      <h1 class="nameplate-name">{{ project }}</h1>
    </div>
    {{ c.counters(counts) }}
  </div>
  <div class="masthead-strip">
    {{ c.composition(segments, "All tasks by lane") }}
    <p class="snapshot">Snapshot {{ today }} · static, not live · ROADMAP.md stays canonical</p>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="controls">{{ c.switches(all_markers) }}</div>

<main>
{{ c.racks_board(racks, false) }}

<section class="boards" aria-labelledby="boards-title">
  <h2 id="boards-title" class="board-title">Phases</h2>
  {% for phase in phases %}{{ c.phase_section(phase) }}{% else %}<p class="phase-empty">No phases declared.</p>{% endfor %}
</section>

{{ c.dep_graph(dag, "main") }}
</main>

{{ c.detail_panel() }}

<footer>Rendered by rmap on {{ today }}. Click any card to pull it out; Esc puts it back.</footer>

<script id="rmap-data" type="application/json">{{ data_island | safe }}</script>
<script>{{ script | safe }}</script>
</body>
</html>
